       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Fixed a bug that caused the rocks to not disappear during the main story quest \"At the Top of the Metal Tree,\" making progression impossible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
