      {
       "text": "• Fixed a bug that caused the game to crash when fast forwarding synthesis.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "• Minor adjustments and bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
